<p>I work in fast food so this is both interesting and&#8230; a little bit odd. Honestly I could look past a store that apparently runs without a walk in freezer (I've done that before, it's not fun but it's <strong>possible</strong>) but there's something else that bothers me.</p>
<p>I can't figure out why this place is still open from reading it. I can imagine any number of scary implications that make it so, but I can't think of any that wouldn't be in the documents itself. If you can give me a justification that makes sense as to why this store is still open in the document itself I'd upvote enthusiastically.</p>

